id: pm-lw6acw
title: "GH-844: local npm package archives are rejected as install sources"
description: Accept bounded local npm package archives as first-class package install sources while preserving provenance and enforcing extraction safety before manifest and entrypoint validation.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-31T12:33:23.036Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-03T09:06:50.397Z"
