author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Accept npm .tgz and .tar.gz package archives through the public SDK and pm package install; Bound extracted entry count and bytes and reject traversal, escaping links, unsupported roots, and ambiguous manifests; Preserve original archive provenance in managed package metadata; Cover npm and Bun offline temp-workspace installation on POSIX and Windows-safe paths"
parent: pm-tnud
risk: high
confidence: high
reporter: github
severity: medium
environment: pm-cli 2026.7.31; npm pack tarball; offline fresh workspace
resolution: "Implemented bounded shell-free local npm archive extraction for .tgz and .tar.gz across local and npm: sources, preserving original provenance and validating the npm package root before installation."
expected_result: "pm package install accepts safe local .tgz and .tar.gz npm package archives, validates a bounded extraction, preserves archive provenance, and behaves consistently through SDK and CLI surfaces."
actual_result: "Safe local npm archives install through SDK and CLI under Node and Bun; traversal, links, unsupported entry types, ambiguous metadata, and configured archive/entry/expanded limits fail before installation."
component: SDK and CLI package source installation
